Z||000002||Fiero*101||09-20-2001||11:27 PM||||Look to see if your back lights work and all your lights for that matter in the back. I know when i bought my 86 SE my back lights didnt work and eather did my turn signals i found out it was a ground wire problem and i couldnt find it so i just re wired a wire from the ground in the battery and spliced it to the wiring in the rear fascia in the lights<BR>it was a bit of work but i would just see if your lights work first  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>hope this helps<P>Fiero*101 ||||reg||1
